    {
      "id": "dojo_stamina_1a",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "1. Jump over the walls. Knockback increases as",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "1. 跳过墙壁。随着时间推移，击退效果会"
    },
