      "text": "time goes on.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "不断增强。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_stamina_2",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "2. Touching a wall means instant failure.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "2. 碰到墙壁会立即失败。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_stamina_3",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "3. Survive for 2 minutes for the highest score.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "3. 坚持 2 分钟即可获得最高分。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_mastery_1",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "1. Shoot the targets.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "1. 射击目标。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_mastery_2",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "2. Headshots reward 2x points.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "2. 爆头可获得 2 倍分数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_mastery_3",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "3. Targets take 4 seconds to activate.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "3. 目标需要 4 秒才能激活。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_mastery_4",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "4. Targets disappear after 6 seconds.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "4. 目标会在 6 秒后消失。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_swiftness_1",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "1. Reach the goal by jumping through blocks.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "1. 踩着方块跳至终点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_swiftness_2",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "2. Blocks disappear shortly after you jump on them.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "2. 踩过的方块很快就会消失。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_swiftness_3",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "3. You have 60 seconds to reach the goal.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "3. 你有 60 秒时间抵达终点。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_control_1",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "1. Aim at the skeleton skulls.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "1. 瞄准骷髅头。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_control_2",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "2. Left-click to shoot, right-click to cancel the shot.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "2. 左键射击，右键取消射击。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_control_3",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "3. Targets further away and smaller reward more points.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "3. 目标越远、越小，得分越高。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_control_4",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "4. Missing a target deducts points.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "4. 射失目标会扣分。"
    },
    {
