      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "2. Getting hit reduces time by 10 seconds.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "2. 每次被击中会扣除 10 秒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "dojo_tenacity_3",
      "context": "道场挑战运行时聊天",
      "text": "3. Earn 1 point for every second survived.",
      "placeholders": [],
      "gloss": "",
      "translate": true,
      "zh": "3. 每坚持 1 秒获得 1 分。"
    },
